stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Absent
    Absent --> Installing: provision.sh
    Installing --> ToolSetup: first logon
    ToolSetup --> Ready: setup-tools.done
    ToolSetup --> Degraded: setup-tools.failed
    Degraded --> ToolSetup: rerun setup-tools.ps1
    Ready --> Stopped: vm.sh stop / kill
    Stopped --> Ready: vm.sh start
    Ready --> Absent: vm.sh destroy
    Stopped --> Absent: vm.sh destroy
    Ready --> Installing: provision.sh --force
